      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean the shortness of breath isnt that bad, its just like a little tightness when i move. and the leg pain is mostly just a dull ache now that i'm walking around a bit. i rly just need to sleep. if i take a high dose of ibuprofen like 800mg every 6 hours i'll be able to sleep through the pain and just wake up feeling better tomorrow, right? i dont think it's anything that requires a doctor if it goes away after i rest.",
